session PRSS = HOL +
  description "
    Termination of the Primitive Sequence System (原始数列システムの停止性).
    Bashicu's Primitive Sequence System, formalized via a map into the
    ordinals below epsilon_0. Two independent developments:
    with-multiset (hereditarily finite multisets, uses HOL-Library.Multiset)
    and without-multiset (Cantor normal forms, imports Main only).
  "
  options [document = false, quick_and_dirty]
  sessions
    "HOL-Library"
  directories
    "with-multiset"
    "without-multiset"
  theories
    prss_ordinal
    prss_defs
    prss_paper
    prss_mechanized
    prss_nomultiset
